---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  page="contact"
  title="Visit &amp; Contact — Iyaganku, Ibadan | That Furniture Girl"
  description="Visit the showroom at Iyaganku, New GRA, Ibadan, or order on WhatsApp 0907 984 9626. Same-day delivery in Ibadan, nationwide delivery arranged."
>
<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Visit &amp; contact</span>
      <h1>Let's talk furniture.</h1>
      <p class="lead">The fastest way to order is WhatsApp — send a photo of the piece you like, tell us your colour and size, and we'll confirm everything from there. You're also welcome to walk into the showroom in Iyaganku, New GRA, Ibadan.</p>
      <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:28px">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="https://wa.me/2349079849626" data-wa="Hello! I would like to order furniture.">Message us on WhatsApp</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline btn--lg" href="tel:+2349079849626">Call 0907 984 9626</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="media-frame media-frame--wide reveal" style="margin-bottom:clamp(26px,4vw,40px)">
        <img src="assets/img/opt/showroom.jpg" alt="The That Furniture Girl showroom in Iyaganku, Ibadan — finished sofas on display under the open timber roof" width="1400" height="874" loading="lazy">
        <div class="media-badge"><strong>The showroom, Iyaganku</strong><span>Walk in and sit down</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-cards">
        <a class="contact-card reveal" href="https://wa.me/2349079849626" data-wa="Hello! I would like to order furniture.">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.46 1.32 4.96L2 22l5.25-1.38a9.87 9.87 0 0 0 4.79 1.22c5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91S17.5 2 12.04 2zm5.43 12.38c-.3-.15-1.75-.86-2.02-.96-.27-.1-.47-.15-.67.15-.2.3-.77.96-.94 1.16-.17.2-.35.22-.64.07-.3-.15-1.26-.46-2.4-1.48-.89-.79-1.49-1.76-1.66-2.06-.17-.3-.02-.46.13-.61.13-.13.3-.35.45-.52.15-.17.2-.3.3-.5.1-.2.05-.37-.02-.52-.08-.15-.67-1.61-.92-2.2-.24-.58-.49-.5-.67-.51h-.57c-.2 0-.52.07-.79.37-.27.3-1.04 1.02-1.04 2.48s1.06 2.88 1.21 3.08c.15.2 2.1 3.2 5.08 4.49.71.3 1.26.49 1.69.63.71.22 1.36.19 1.87.12.57-.09 1.75-.72 2-1.41.25-.69.25-1.28.17-1.41-.07-.13-.27-.2-.57-.35z"/></svg>
          <strong>WhatsApp — fastest</strong>
          <span>0907 984 9626</span>
          <span class="link-arrow" style="margin-top:6px">Start a chat
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <a class="contact-card reveal" data-delay="1" href="tel:+2349079849626">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 3h3l2 5-2.5 1.5a12 12 0 0 0 6 6L15 13l5 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2A17 17 0 0 1 3 5.2 2 2 0 0 1 5 3z"/></svg>
          <strong>Call the workshop</strong>
          <span>0907 984 9626</span>
          <span class="link-arrow" style="margin-top:6px">Tap to call
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="contact-card reveal" data-delay="2">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a15 15 0 0 1 0 18a15 15 0 0 1 0-18z"/></svg>
          <strong>Follow the builds</strong>
          <span>New pieces are posted most weeks — that's usually how customers find us.</span>
          <span class="link-arrow" style="margin-top:6px"><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@thatfurnituregirl_" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="border:0">TikTok</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="https://www.instagram.com/thatfurnituregirl__" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="border:0">Instagram</a></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split split--wide-left" style="align-items:start">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Ordering</span>
        <h2>Four steps, one conversation.</h2>
        <div class="steps" style="grid-template-columns:1fr; margin-top:30px">
          <div class="step">
            <span class="step__num">01</span>
            <h3>Send the piece (or the idea)</h3>
            <p>Message the piece name from our collection, a photo you love, or your room's measurements. Screenshots and voice notes are welcome.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <span class="step__num">02</span>
            <h3>Confirm colour, size and price</h3>
            <p>We'll send fabric and colour options and confirm the final price before any work begins.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <span class="step__num">03</span>
            <h3>We build it</h3>
            <p>5–10 working days for most pieces. You'll get progress photos as your furniture comes together.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <span class="step__num">04</span>
            <h3>Delivery or pickup</h3>
            <p>Same-day delivery in Ibadan, nationwide delivery arranged, or collect it yourself from the showroom.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="split reveal" data-delay="1" style="grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:20px; position:sticky; top:110px">
        <div class="card" style="background:var(--surface-2); border-color:transparent">
          <span class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px">The showroom</span>
          <h3>Iyaganku, Ibadan</h3>
          <p style="font-size:.95rem">Walk-ins are welcome. Message us before you come and we'll have the pieces you're interested in ready for you to sit on, and swatches out for you to feel.</p>
          <div class="footer-links" style="margin-top:6px; font-size:.92rem">
            <span><strong style="color:var(--ink)">Address</strong><br>Iyaganku, New GRA, Ibadan 200273, Oyo State, Nigeria</span>
            <span><strong style="color:var(--ink)">Visiting</strong><br>Message us for today's availability before you travel</span>
            <span><strong style="color:var(--ink)">Delivery</strong><br>Same-day in Ibadan · nationwide on request</span>
          </div>
          <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:8px">
            <a class="btn btn--outline btn--sm" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=7.375526,3.868076" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get directions</a>
            <a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" href="https://wa.me/2349079849626" data-wa="Hello! I would like to visit the showroom. When is a good time?">Plan a visit</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem">Bringing in a design?</h3>
          <p style="font-size:.95rem">Send photos of the room, the measurements, and any inspiration pictures. The more we know, the closer we get to what you've pictured — and the price we quote is the price you pay.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--sand">
    <div class="container split split--wide-left" style="align-items:start">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Quick answers</span>
        <h2>Before you message</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="margin-top:16px">We're always active — but here are the questions that come up most.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq reveal" data-delay="1">
        <details open>
          <summary>Do you deliver outside Ibadan?</summary>
          <p>Yes. Same-day delivery is available across Ibadan, and we arrange delivery to other states nationwide. Send us your address and we'll tell you the cost before you commit.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How soon can I get my furniture?</summary>
          <p>Some pieces are available for immediate pickup from the showroom. Built-to-order pieces usually take 5–10 working days — wardrobes around 5 days, centre tables around 10 — and large bespoke commissions take longer.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can I pay on delivery?</summary>
          <p>Payment arrangements are agreed on WhatsApp when you order, and we'll always spell out what is due and when before we start building. Ask us directly and we'll explain the options for your piece.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>I'm not in Nigeria — can I still order?</summary>
          <p>Absolutely. We build for customers abroad who are furnishing a home, an apartment or a family property in Nigeria. We'll send photos and videos of progress so you can approve finishes from wherever you are.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tight cta-band">
    <div class="container cta-band__inner">
      <div class="reveal">
        <h2>Tell us what you need.</h2>
        <p style="margin-top:16px; max-width:48ch">One message is usually all it takes to get started — no forms, no waiting.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row reveal" data-delay="1">
        <a class="btn btn--light btn--lg" href="https://wa.me/2349079849626" data-wa="Hello! I would like to order furniture. Here is what I need: ">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost-light btn--lg" href="shop.html">Browse the collection</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>


</Base>
